      ":question/problem": "Consider the augmented matrix $A,$ given by\n\n$$\nA=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}4 & -1 & 9 \\\\ 6 & 5 & -6 \\\\ -1 & -9 & 1\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nWhat matrix results from carrying out the row operation $R_{1}\\leftrightarrow R_{2}$ on $A?$",
