      ":question/problem": "Consider the augmented matrix $A,$ given by\n\n$$\nA=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 3 & 8 & -1 \\\\ 7 & 1 & -9 & 4 \\\\ 6 & -3 & 9 & 0\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nWhat matrix results from carrying out the row operation $R_{3}:=-\\frac{1}{3}R_{3}$ on $A?$",
